# ==============================================================================
# targets - K3s Multi-Node Remote Provisioning Targets File
# ==============================================================================
# List one target host IP or user@host per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Used by: ./up k3s:up, ./src/k3s_add_node.sh, ./src/k3s_ping.sh, ./src/k3s_kill.sh
#
# Examples:
# 192.168.1.50
# 192.168.1.51
# root@192.168.1.52
# worker-node-03.local
